<%# Handoff 0068 R2 -- a code-drawn placeholder for a product-list card with no cover image, matching the
    real cover's aspect ratio (16:9, aspect-video) so every card in the grid is the same height regardless of
    which ones have an uploaded cover. Purely decorative (aria-hidden, no text an assistive-tech user would
    care about) -- never mistaken for a real upload; the admin list/edit screens still say "대표 이미지 없음"
    exactly as before (unchanged by this handoff).
    Handoff 0071: `dark: true` gives the same placeholder in the home's dark palette. %>
<% dark = local_assigns.fetch(:dark, false) %>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="<%= local_assigns.fetch(:classes, "") %> flex aspect-video w-full items-center justify-center <%= dark ? "bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1b1e25] via-[#161920] to-[#0e1014]" : "bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 via-blue-50 to-slate-100" %>">
  <span class="text-4xl font-black <%= dark ? "text-[#f0a53c]/40" : "text-indigo-200" %>"><%= product_line.customer_name.first %></span>
</div>
